  "content": "\n\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">防止船隻在冰上快速移動。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/mod_loader-forge-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=ffced2\" alt=\"模組載入器\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/game_version-1.17_to_1.20.x-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=ffced2\" alt=\"遊戲版本\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/environment-client_|_server-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=ffced2\" alt=\"客戶端│服務端\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-boat-nerf-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/897459?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&labelColor=ffceea&color=ffe8f5\" alt=\"下載次數\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/kawaiicakes/IceBoatNerfReforged/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/kawaiicakes/IceBoatNerfReforged?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=ffceea&color=ffe8f5\" alt=\"問題回報\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/kawaiicakes/IceBoatNerfReforged/blob/main/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-ffe8f5?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=ffceea\" alt=\"授權\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/kawaiicakes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-github-fee8ff?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=fcceff\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-discord-fee8ff?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&labelColor=fcceff\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\">我的模組將不再於 Curseforge 上提供更新！請前往 </span></strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fkawaiicakes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth。</a></strong></span></span></h1>\n<p>阻止船隻在冰面上以馬赫 30 的速度滑行。取而代之的，是木槳刮擦冰面時那種令人不悅的觸覺與聽覺衝擊。撰寫此模組的原因在於：我所知的 Forge 1.19.2 版本皆與 Quark 打包在一起。對不起，Vazkii &lt;/3</p>\n<hr>\n<h1>💗 鳴謝與致謝</h1>\n<p>必須感謝&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0cf\"><a style=\"color:#0cf\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitlab.com%252fsupersaiyansubtlety\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3cc\">supersaiyansubtlety</span></a></span>發現了正確的浮點數值，以實現精確的船隻摩擦力。</p>",
